# V generated files
#
# `v run` / `v .` produce executables with NO file extension (e.g. hello-world/hello),
# which a normal pattern list cannot match. So: ignore everything, then allow
# source files and Exercism metadata back in.

*

# Always descend into directories so the rules below can match
!*/

# Source & config
!*.v
!*.vsh
!v.mod
!vpkg.json

# Exercism docs / metadata
!*.md
!*.json
!*.txt
!.gitignore

# Explicit build artifacts (also covered by the catch-all above)
*.exe
*.so
*.dll
*.dylib
*.a
*_test
vls.log
.bin/
